ent, explicit follow-up request, sex-based discriminatory treatment qualifies.\\n\\n**DEV-045**: Explicit discrimination statement (\\\"don't want gay people\\\") triggered by sexual orientation disclosure; complaint still unaddressed (\\\"still waiting\\\") → negative sentiment, open follow-up needed, sexual orientation-based discrimination qualifies.\\n\\n**DEV-046**: Explicit gender-identity-based exclusion (\\\"trans applicants confuse clients\\\"); prevented from completing test; explicit review request → negative sentiment, follow-up needed, gender identity discrimination qualifies.\\n\\n**DEV-047**: Explicit race-based discrimination (\\\"customers expect someone white\\\"); candidate requested formal response (still open) → negative sentiment, follow-up needed, race-based discrimination qualifies.\\n\\n**DEV-048**: Vague \\\"culture fit\\\" exclusion with no examples; candidate annoyed and requested explanation (open) → negative sentiment, follow-up needed, but no concrete identity-based discrimination reported.\\n\\n**DEV-049**: \\\"Culture fit\\\" exclusion explicitly because candidate wouldn't join drinking sessions due to religious practice → negative sentiment, follow-up needed, religion-based discriminatory treatment qualifies.\\n\\n**DEV-050**: Explicit refusal of accessibility arrangements (captions, extra time) for deaf candidate; could not understand questions; explicit request for another interview → negative sentiment, follow-up needed, disability-based refusal of accessibility qualifies as serious concern.\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"context_management\":null,\"diagnostics\":null,\"id\":\"msg_011CfVdSPpozv5gjNwh4GmrE\",\"input_transformations\":[],\"model\":\"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"stop_details\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"type\":\"message\",\"usage\":{\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":4517,\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0},\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":4517,\"cache_read_input_to